      "content": "I don't understand... the shadows are getting thicker. Are you saying the debt can't be paid even in death? That I'm just stuck in this cycle of shame forever? There has to be some kind of release. A way to meet them in the halls of our ancestors, to face them with my sword instead of this hollow, rotting life in a tent. Tell me... is there no honor left in a final stand?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
